   41: **F10 (READ).** P6 (stepped instruction fetch at LUNA address) is clause (e), not floor; the floor cross-product does not include device identity. VA != PA, sub-word PFAR, LUNA store are clause (e). No other floor cell is unrowed, but the instruction-x-NULL delivery observable remains unrowed (P15, L4).
