   49: **F14 (READ).** Gate block and MANIFEST lines are sound: literal row count, all 31 names, sentinel once, CONTROL=OK, SYMPTOM=ABSENT, emitted/green/red counts. Regex satisfiable; longest name 13 � 15. Skip disclosure adequate.
   50: 
   51: **Q2(i) - one ask-again.**
   52: - **AA1** - *CMMU owner confusion*: use boot CPU's CMMU when faulting CPU's pointer is NULL. Cell: data-x-absent and instruction-x-absent. **FLOOR (L2).**
   53: - **AA2** - *PFAR stores virtual address instead of physical*. Cell: data-x-present and instruction-x-present. **CLAUSE (e)** (VA != PA disclaimed).
